<html><head><meta charset='utf-8'>
<style>
table { border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; }
th, td { border: 1px solid #ddd; padding: 4px; text-align: center; }
th { background-color: #f2f2f2; }
.up { background-color: #ff9999; color: black; }
.down { background-color: #99ccff; color: black; }
.none { background-color: #ffffff; color: #ccc; }
</style>
</head><body>
<h2>Common Metabolites Heatmap (FDR < 0.1 in >= 2 categories)</h2>
<p>Colors: <span style='background-color:#ff9999'><b>Red</b></span> = Upregulated (FDR < 0.1, logFC > 0), <span style='background-color:#99ccff'><b>Blue</b></span> = Downregulated (FDR < 0.1, logFC < 0).</p>
<p>Significance: ** (FDR < 0.05), * (FDR < 0.1). Cells show logFC.</p>
<table>
